# 1Password secret references for OpenCode.
# Resolved at launch by `op run --env-file` (see the `oc` alias in the shell).
# op:// pointers carry no secret material, so this file is safe to track.
# Fill in your own paths: "Copy Secret Reference" in the 1Password app.
GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=op://Private/Github/opencode PAT

# Uncomment when context7 needs a paid API key:
# CONTEXT7_API_KEY=op://Private/<vault>/<item>/<field>
